      "context_excerpt": "Quantum computing promises to reshape industries — but progress hinges on solving key problems. Error correction. Simulations of qubit designs. Circuit compilation optimization tasks. These are among the bottlenecks that must be overcome to bring quantum hardware into the era of useful applications.",
