      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "The University of Edinburgh used the NVIDIA CUDA-Q QEC library to build a new qLDPC decoding method called AutoDEC — and saw a 2x boost in speed and accuracy. It was developed using CUDA-Q’s GPU-accelerated BP-OSD decoding functionality, which parallelizes the decoding process, increasing the odds that error correction works.",
